  "title": "UK-Iranian Dual National Bailed After RAF Fairford Incident Arrest",
  "summary": "A dual UK-Iranian national was arrested and bailed after a counter-terrorism investigation into a suspected terrorist plot at RAF Fairford. The UK Prime Minister stated that Iran is involved in the incident as part of a broader investigation.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "A 25-year-old dual UK-Iranian national was arrested on suspicion of preparing terrorist acts under section 5 of the Terrorism Act 2006.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The 25-year-old was the sixth man detained as part of a counter-terrorism investigation into a potential foreign state involvement at RAF Fairford.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The UK and US are working closely to address the matter.",
